    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2VncZsisuSw6LY8LZia9364)_\n\nd670747 removed `(require 'sp-org-node-mem)` from `sp-org-ext.el` only, so the `tangle` check failed on `main` and on #272. This removes the \"ID-based workflows\" section from `docs/tangles/text/sp-org-ext.org` so the doc tangles to the current `.el`. The `sp-org-node-mem` module and its doc are untouched. CHANGELOG entry added.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container); the `tangle` check is the test.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCrRWec3LtT3WLhGCc)_",
